WEBVTT

1
00:00:11.115 --> 00:00:19.556
The bunnies hopped to the farm.

2
00:00:19.557 --> 00:00:22.807
"Jemima!" Benjamin called.

3
00:00:22.808 --> 00:00:25.556
"We are looking for an old boot."

4
00:00:25.557 --> 00:00:28.251
"Oh," Jemima said.

5
00:00:28.252 --> 00:00:30.998
"I wanted to make a nest in that boot.

6
00:00:30.999 --> 00:00:33.876
But it was too small for my eggs."

7
00:00:33.877 --> 00:00:35.843
"Great!" Peter said.

8
00:00:35.844 --> 00:00:37.916
"Can we have the boot?"

9
00:00:37.917 --> 00:00:40.499
"No," Jemima said.

10
00:00:40.500 --> 00:00:45.164
"I gave the boot to Tom Kitten.

11
00:00:45.165 --> 00:00:53.941
He gave me hay."

12
00:00:53.942 --> 00:01:00.709
The bunnies hopped away.

13
00:01:00.710 --> 00:01:04.197
They found Tom near some big rocks.

14
00:01:04.198 --> 00:01:15.017
"Do you have the boot?" Benjamin called.

15
00:01:15.018 --> 00:01:19.212
Tom nodded sadly.

16
00:01:19.213 --> 00:01:23.021
"Yes, but . . ."

17
00:01:23.022 --> 00:01:25.317
He pointed to the boot.

18
00:01:25.318 --> 00:01:28.351
It was stuck between two rocks.

19
00:01:28.352 --> 00:01:31.594
"We need that boot!" Peter said.

20
00:01:31.595 --> 00:01:37.455
"Can we have it?" Benjamin asked.

21
00:01:37.456 --> 00:01:40.619
"Okay," Tom said.

22
00:01:40.620 --> 00:01:44.655
"I will give you the boot.

23
00:01:44.656 --> 00:01:47.535
Will you give me some candy?"

24
00:01:47.536 --> 00:01:51.814
"Okay." Peter reached into his pockets.

25
00:01:51.815 --> 00:01:58.225
He gasped. "Where is all my candy?"

26
00:01:58.226 --> 00:02:02.930
Peter had just one piece left.

27
00:02:02.931 --> 00:02:09.401
He gave it to Tom.

28
00:02:09.402 --> 00:02:14.958
"Bye!" Tom said.

29
00:02:14.959 --> 00:02:17.420
The bunnies grabbed the boot.

30
00:02:17.421 --> 00:02:27.385
They pulled hard.

31
00:02:27.386 --> 00:02:31.208
But it was still stuck!
